#: ../../explanation/architecture.md:51 dac193a4512148f5bf436706b4eeb766
msgid ""
"GWexpy data flow from raw arrays and GWpy objects through matrix and field "
"analysis paths, with axis metadata preserved across reshaping and "
"transforms."
msgstr ""

#: ../../explanation/architecture.md:54 c09ea18ea7fd464ea569908a97edcb8e
msgid "Reading notes:"
msgstr "読み方の要点:"

#: ../../explanation/architecture.md:56 985cc4e51f9943b9bb0bfcb93fa6fcf5
msgid ""
"`TimeSeriesDict -> TimeSeriesMatrix -> Flatten to 2D features` is the "
"matrix-analysis path used when scikit-learn-style algorithms expect 2D "
"inputs."
msgstr ""
"`TimeSeriesDict -> TimeSeriesMatrix -> 2次元特徴量へ平坦化` は、scikit-learn 系の 2 "
"次元入力へ接続するための行列解析経路です。"

#: ../../explanation/architecture.md:57 710ae014076d437782e7410ee8d15ff1
msgid ""
"`ScalarField -> Field slicing / indexing -> Field-aware transforms` is the "
"field-analysis path used when time, frequency, and spatial axes must stay "
"aligned."
msgstr ""
"`ScalarField -> フィールドのスライス / インデクシング -> フィールド対応変換` "
"は、時間・周波数・空間軸を揃えたまま扱うフィールド解析経路です。"

#: ../../explanation/architecture.md:58 7dfa9af3be3f414d88417b9d692e93b7
msgid ""
"Metadata is preserved across both paths so derived outputs can still be "
"interpreted in physical coordinates rather than raw array indices alone."
msgstr "どちらの経路でもメタデータを保持するため、結果を単なる配列インデックスではなく物理座標に対応づけて解釈できます。"

#: ../../explanation/architecture.md:63 178d3f5b06424333af64ec17b3da8f6c
msgid "Core Analysis Components"
msgstr "主要な解析コンポーネントの概念"

#: ../../explanation/architecture.md:65 37182eccf4d849689e6e27e83062fc9d
msgid ""
"`gwexpy` builds advanced analysis pipelines by combining the following core "
"components. For detailed mathematical and physical foundations, refer to "
"[Physics Models and Analysis Theory](physics_models.md)."
msgstr ""
"`gwexpy` は、以下の主要コンポーネントを組み合わせて高度な解析パイプラインを構築します。個別のアルゴリズム詳細は "
"[物理モデルと解析理論](physics_models.md) を参照してください。"

#: ../../explanation/architecture.md:67 583e56629fa14140a886b63e1d32b95f
msgid ""
"**Multi-channel Analysis Engine**: Implementation of ICA/PCA for "
"environmental noise isolation."
msgstr "**多チャネル解析エンジン**: 環境ノイズ分離のための ICA/PCA 実装。"

#: ../../explanation/architecture.md:68 b9b4c9e5218c41c09dd8fc4ea723bf06
msgid ""
"**Fast Correlation Framework**: Accelerated coherence calculations (Bruco) "
"for large-scale observation data."
msgstr "**高速相関計算基盤**: 大規模観測データに対する高速コヒーレンス計算（BruCo）。"

#: ../../explanation/architecture.md:69 0ec7a1f5fdff464fa54f1c802ed65b43
msgid ""
"**Statistical Inference & Fitting**: Parameter estimation using GLS and "
"MCMC."
msgstr "**統計的推定・フィッティング**: GLS や MCMC を用いた物理パラメータ推定。"

